# ADR-0150: ship the darwin-arm64 napi binary (the loader's local-file check
# needs it); exclude only OTHER arches. A blanket `*.node` here shipped an
# empty @ruvector/attention → "Cannot find module …attention-darwin-arm64".
*.linux-*.node
*.win32-*.node
*.android-*.node
*.darwin-x64*.node
*.darwin-universal*.node
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
